# CQ6 (INHABITED-COMPETENCY.md, INHABITED-RUNTIME-STACK.md): which
# artifact / deployment / runtime / session / invocation produced an output? The
# de-conflation chain resolves end to end, each hop named. Over
# provenance-chain.ttl this walks output → invocation → execution → deployment →
# artifact, and invocation → session, so an output is traced to the exact served
# artifact and the session it belonged to. This is the STANDALONE-resolvable
# prefix of the chain (the session → durable-subject terminus lives in the
# agent-runtime profile, where core/inhabitation is present). The flat one-hop
# gmeow:generatedForSubject shortcut is a computed projection of this same path;
# the projection-agreement gate proves the two agree (Principle 12 / 7).
PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
SELECT ?output ?invocation ?execution ?deployment ?artifact ?session WHERE {
    ?output gmeow:wasGeneratedBy ?invocation .
    ?invocation gmeow:invocationInExecution ?execution ;
        gmeow:subEventOf ?session .
    ?execution gmeow:executionOfDeployment ?deployment .
    ?deployment gmeow:deploymentArtifact ?artifact .
    ?session a gmeow:AgentSession .
}
